      "title": "Getting Started: Inpaint",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Win Models Inpaint Template\n\nGeneric inpaint workflow with a checkpoint loader, Multi LoRA Stack, StringReplace prompt templates, image and mask encode, sampler, VAE decode, and save node.\n\nChoose a checkpoint, choose an input image, paint a mask in the image node, edit the prompt templates, and queue the prompt."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -170,
        370
      ],
      "size": [
        470,
        320
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 3,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Note: Load Model",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Choose the checkpoint in Load Checkpoint. LoRA files can be added in Multi LoRA Stack. Keep model files under the configured ComfyUI model root so the dropdowns can find them."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
